# Git Commit Message

When generating a Git commit message for this repository:

- Write the subject and body in Simplified Chinese (简体中文)
- Use Conventional Commits: `type(scope): 中文说明`
- `type` / `scope` may stay in English (e.g. `feat`, `fix`, `record`)
- Prefer one short subject line; only add a brief body when needed
- Focus on why, not a line-by-line restatement of the diff

Example: `feat(record): 历史记录页支持点击月份选择年月`
